trate behavior here. Overall, the molecule carries a few CYP2C9-relevant acidic/phenolic signals, but these are counterbalanced by very low logD, a fully flat scaffold, and only moderate overall structural support for the classic anionic-aromatic substrate pattern. On balance, the non-substrate prediction is more convincing."
